        "created_at": "2013-01-04T00:09:16.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Alex\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/alex/48/2059_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Alex:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>So would this mean that if Mr. Fixer got, say, the Rod of Anubis and played Overdrive, he could use the Rod's power during his power phase and then still use his Strike power twice this turn?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>It appears so.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://sentinelsofthemultiverse.com/forum/topic/overdrive-plus-rod-anubis\" class=\"onebox\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">https://sentinelsofthemultiverse.com/forum/topic/overdrive-plus-rod-anubis</a></p>\n<p>I will have to try this. &nbsp;Anything that makes Mr. Fixer hit more is a welcome addition.&nbsp;</p>",
